{"channelId":"UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","row":["WesternU College of Veterinary Medicine",20,"Western University of Health Sciences, College of Veterinary Medicine (established in 1998), is located in sunny Pomona, California. As one of the nation’s distinguished veterinary schools, we take pride in nurturing cooperative learning, public service, and scholarship, ensuring our graduates are exceptionally well-prepared to excel in their careers. We celebrate a diverse student and faculty body, believing that diversity enriches our educational experience and fosters a deeper understanding of global veterinary healthcare. Together, we cultivate an environment of mutual respect, collaboration, and compassion, preparing our graduates to serve all communities with excellence and empathy.","admissions@westernu.edu; alumni@westernu.edu; finaid@westernu.edu; lead@westernu.edu; publicaffairs@westernu.edu; studentaffairs@westernu.edu; webdesignteam@westernu.edu","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:30.235Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:30.235Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":20,"raw":"20 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCd5QH-tDCIUmpUvY0AbfWWA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:30.235Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"admissions@westernu.edu","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.westernu.edu/university/contact-us/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:1e88a73f7c0c4ba30f7257a5"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:42:41.130Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: admissions@westernu.edu\nH